So, my name is pronounced Yelena and I am a graduate from PhD, a graduate, a master's

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:40.690
graduate from ICS department from UC Irvine.

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:48.850
I also have diploma of engineering from School of Electrical Engineering from Belgrade University,

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:51.170
Serbia former Yugoslavia.

