Before that, I was assistant professor

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:05.970
in Concordia University,

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:09.170
not related to the neighboring Concordia University

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:10.230
in Montreal.

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:15.890
Before that, I was Resmic postdoctoral fellow

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:20.890
and Resmic is research organization

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:31.010
for microelectronics in Quebec and that position I was holding in a cold polytechnic demo and

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:40.770
during my PhD I did tons of TAing at this ICS department at UC Irvine. So therefore I taught

