00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:13.790
you're going to answer some quiz questions,

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:17.430
and that's going to be before each class.

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:20.250
That knowledge of yours is going to support you

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.090
in in-class activities.

00:07:22.090 --> 00:07:25.050
Each class, you're going to have a worksheet

00:07:25.050 --> 00:07:27.250
and you are going to work on that worksheet.

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:29.050
those problems are going to build

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:32.250
on top of the theory that we learned.

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:35.170
So, and those risks are going to be provided

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:37.370
also a little bit ahead of time.

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:42.370
And I'm going to strongly encourage you to make teams.

